<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Moneyfacts Multi-Factor Dashboard</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --primary-blue: #1a3a5c;
            --accent-blue: #4472c4;
            --success-green: #70ad47;
            --warning-red: #e74c3c;
            --warning-orange: #ff9800;
            --bg-dark: #0f1419;
            --bg-medium: #1a1f2e;
            --bg-light: #242b3d;
            --text-primary: #e8eaed;
            --text-secondary: #9aa0a6;
            --border-color: #2d3748;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1419 0%, #1a1f2e 100%);
            color: #e8eaed;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .dashboard { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3a5c 0%, #4472c4 100%);
            padding: 2rem 3rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(68, 114, 196, 0.2);
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
        }
        .subtitle { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .nav a {
            padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .nav a.active { background: white; color: #1a3a5c; }
        
        .policy-gap-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e74c3c 0%, #c0392b 100%);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border: 2px solid #c0392b;
        }
        .policy-gap-value {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            color: white;
        }
        .policy-gap-label {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .factors-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .factor-card {
            background: #242b3d;
            border: 2px solid;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .factor-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .factor-card.external { border-color: #ff9800; }
        .factor-card.internal { border-color: #9c27b0; }
        .factor-card.tradeoff { border-color: #2196f3; }
        
        .factor-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .factor-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        .factor-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
        }
        .factor-card.external .factor-title { color: #ff9800; }
        .factor-card.internal .factor-title { color: #9c27b0; }
        .factor-card.tradeoff .factor-title { color: #2196f3; }
        
        .factor-impact {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
            color: #e74c3c;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        
        .factor-breakdown {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .breakdown-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }
        .breakdown-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .breakdown-value {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
        }
        
        .live-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            background: rgba(112,173,71,0.2);
            color: #70ad47;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-left: 0.5rem;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.6; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="dashboard">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">MONEYFACTS® POLICY DASHBOARD</div>
            <div class="subtitle">Why Bank of England Cannot Comply with Rules of Thumb</div>
            <div class="nav">
                <a href="index.html" class="active">Multi-Factor Analysis</a>
                <a href="charts.html">Charts</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="last-update" style="text-align:center; color:#9aa0a6; margin-bottom:1.5rem; font-size:0.9rem;">Loading live data...</div>

        <div class="policy-gap-banner">
            <div class="policy-gap-value" id="policy-gap">--</div>
            <div class="policy-gap-label">BBR POLICY GAP (Current 3.75% vs Required)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="factors-grid">
            <!-- Factor 1: External Shocks -->
            <div class="factor-card external">
                <div class="factor-header">
                    <div class="factor-icon">🌍</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="factor-title">1. EXTERNAL SHOCKS<span class="live-badge">LIVE</span></div>
                        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#9aa0a6;">Iran War • Oil Crisis</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="factor-impact" id="external-impact">--</div>
                <div class="factor-breakdown" id="external-breakdown"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Factor 2: Internal Constraints -->
            <div class="factor-card internal">
                <div class="factor-header">
                    <div class="factor-icon">🏠</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="factor-title">2. INTERNAL CONSTRAINTS</div>
                        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#9aa0a6;">Productivity • Fiscal Policy</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="factor-impact" id="internal-impact">--</div>
                <div class="factor-breakdown" id="internal-breakdown"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Factor 3: Policy Trade-off -->
            <div class="factor-card tradeoff">
                <div class="factor-header">
                    <div class="factor-icon">⚖️</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="factor-title">3. POLICY TRADE-OFF</div>
                        <div style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#9aa0a6;">Recession Risk</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="factor-impact" id="unemployment-rate">--</div>
                <div style="color:#9aa0a6; margin-top:1rem;">
                    Raising BBR to recommended level would deepen recession with unemployment already at decade-high.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        async function loadData() {
            try {
                const response = await fetch('http://localhost:5001/api/dashboard-data');
                const data = await response.json();
                
                // Policy Gap
                document.getElementById('policy-gap').textContent = 
                    (data.policy_gap * 100).toFixed(2) + 'pp';
                
                // External Shocks
                document.getElementById('external-impact').textContent = 
                    '+' + (data.external_shock).toFixed(2) + 'pp';


